# Kept out of what the controller image's build is sent: .git, .venv*, node_modules, __pycache__, data and .env*
# files. The image copies app/, tests/ (the suite runs in the image), pyproject.toml, entrypoint.sh,
# requirements.txt, requirements-dev.txt and constraints.txt: none of them may be ignored here.
.git
**/.venv*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
data
**/.env*
